    "# Text-to-SQL fine-tuning: baseline and training\n",
    "\n",
    "Runs on a Kaggle GPU. All real code lives in the GitHub repo; this notebook only sets up, calls it, and shows the results.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Before you start:** Settings \u2192 Accelerator \u2192 **GPU T4 \u00d72**, Internet **On**, and Secrets `HF_TOKEN` and `WANDB_API_KEY` switched on for this notebook.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Section | What it does |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| 0 | Check the GPU and the secrets |\n",
    "| 1 | Get the code and rebuild the data |\n",
    "| 2 | Prove the data is identical to the Mac copy |\n",
    "| 3 | Baseline: score the untrained model |\n",
    "| 4 | Read the wrong answers |\n",
    "| 5+ | Training and evaluation (added as we build them) |\n",
    "\n",
    "After a session restart, run sections 0 to 2 again, because the disk is wiped."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 0. Check the GPU and secrets\n",
    "We need a GPU, and both secrets should print `found`. Values are never printed."
